<title>UK: Norway's Dec Statfjord loadings down at 29 cargoes.</title>
<headline>Norway's Dec Statfjord loadings down at 29 cargoes.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's Statfjord crude system is expected to load 29 cargoes in December, one fewer than in November, trading sources said on Friday.  </p>
<p>Statfjord crude is loaded offshore in 855,000-barrel shipments.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7930</p>
</text>
